Flow-Like native forecasting implementations

The Timestral, Chronos-2, Toto 2, TimesFM 2.5 and TinyTimeMixer modules adapt the
following Apache-2.0 implementations to Rust and Burn. The changes include
native tensor execution, checkpoint loading, a shared forecasting contract
and validation tests.

